; Per-frame update for Sprite 0's two-phase fall/return animation.
; Increments the global tick counter, then bails early if sprite movement is
; inactive (a_C19C=0). Decrements the step-delay timer (a_2A7F); when it
; reaches zero, the routine either advances the easing-out phase (a_C19B=0:
; step index 0→$18, progressively longer delays from table a_544A, checks
; sprite/char collision and Y-stall) or rewinds the easing-in phase
; (a_C19B=1: step index $18→0, progressively shorter delays, calls s_5467).
; Once the step index rewinds to 0, clears a_C19C (animation complete) and
; resets a_534E to $18.
